message: "If you use these conjectures or this code, please cite it as below."
title: "gpu-pcf-conjectures: three continued fraction conjectures found by GPU search"
authors:
  - family-names: "El Hmissi"
    given-names: "Maher"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24485589"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Maher75017/gpu-pcf-conjectures"
abstract: "Three polynomial continued fractions found by a GPU search, matching 1/(pi-3), 2/ln(27/16) and 3/ln(1024/729) to about 220 digits; not found in Cohen (arXiv 2304.11727), the Ramanujan Machine paper or the public LIReC database. Numerical conjectures, not theorems."
keywords:
  - continued fractions
  - experimental mathematics
  - Ramanujan Machine
  - conjectures
  - GPU
